# Models the application downloads at runtime. They differ from machine to
# machine, and letting them into the build context made the image depend on
# whatever the builder had already run - which is how a missing embedder went
# unnoticed for so long. docker/prefetch-models.sh puts a pinned copy in the
# image instead, so the build no longer depends on the builder's own state.
**/server/storage/models/Xenova/
